# large crash dumps kept locally as evidence, not committed
verify/menu_crash_pc44/*.dmp

# --- Capture blobs under verify/ (2026-08-24) ---
# Extends the menu_crash_pc44/*.dmp precedent above to the capture pools. At the
# time of writing the 36 surviving verify/ dirs held 1,424,801,792 bytes of
# .bmp/.msd/.png against 2,029,217 bytes of .txt/.json -- 99.9% blobs. Those
# blobs are regenerable by the harness that produced them, so they stay local.
# What IS committed for every cited directory: its RESULT.md/AUDIT.md/README.md
# verdict (already tracked), its .txt/.json telemetry, and a row in
# verify/EVIDENCE_MANIFEST.md giving counts, bytes and the tracked files that
# cite it. That keeps every citation resolvable, which is the D0.6 lesson --
# citations into untrackable paths are latent fragility, and 35 of these dirs are
# cited by hooks.csv / UNCERTAINTIES.md / DEFERRED.md / ROADMAP.md.
# NOTE this does not retract the 322,698,309 bytes of blobs already in history.
verify/**/*.bmp
verify/**/*.msd
verify/**/*.png

# transient reference-save backup (never commit)
original/gamesave.bin.refbak_*
